&ndash; Operating margin: Calculated as Income from Operations for the quarter divided by Total Net Revenue for the quarter.<BR>
&ndash; Net profit margin: Calculated as Net Income for the quarter divided by Total Net Revenue for the quarter.<BR>
&ndash; Annualized Net Income: Calculated by multiplying the net income for the quarter by four to estimate a full-year equivalent.<BR>
&ndash; Return on equity: Calculated as Annualized Net Income divided by the average of Total Shareholders&rsquo; Equity at the beginning
and end of the quarter. This measure presents a full-year equivalent ROE based on a single quarter&rsquo;s performance.</P>
